        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Keep the stock hot in a separate pan throughout cooking. Adding cold stock slows the process and affects the texture. Add the wine with white wine vinegar here if you have no wine to hand, though a dry white wine gives a better result." }]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "What you need" }]
